16,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":0,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.001072,\"contextWindow\":200000,\"maxOutputTokens\":32000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-haiku-4-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"},\"claude-sonnet-5\":{\"inputTokens\":40,\"outputTokens\":6661,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":1212496,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":60607,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.8274258,\"contextWindow\":1000000,\"maxOutputTokens\":64000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-sonnet-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"}},\"permission_denials\":[],\"terminal_reason\":\"completed\",\"fast_mode_state\":\"off\",\"fast_mode_disabled_reason\":\"sdk_opt_in_required\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"api_error_status\":null,\"result\":\"All relevant tests pass. Full package build succeeds (`go build ./...`) with no changes to go.mod/go.sum.\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nThe bug was in `BranchesFor` in `internal/cli/export.go`. It checked the checkpoint's recorded metadata branch *before* checking default-branch reachability, so a checkpoint originally recorded on a since-merged feature branch (which still has a non-empty `metadataBranch`) was always routed to `sessions/branches/<feature-branch>/`, even though `buildCheckpointBranchDestinations` had already computed that its checkpoint ID is reachable from the default branch.\\n\\nFix: reorder the checks so default-branch reachability (`DefaultCheckpointIDs`) is checked first, falling back to the recorded metadata branch only when the checkpoint isn't reachable from the default branch (i.e., truly unmerged work). This restores the intended semantics confirmed by prior project history: merged work lands in `sessions/<default-branch>/` while `SourceBranch` still preserves where the session originated.\\n\\nValidation:\\n- `go build ./...` \u2014 passed\\n- `go test ./internal/cli/...` filtered to export/branch/snapshot-related tests (`TestExport*`, `TestSnapshot*`, `TestDiscoverCheckpoints*`, plus the broader `Export|Branch|Snapshot` run including `TestVerifySessionLookupIsBranchScoped`) \u2014 all passed\\n\\nNo test files, `go.mod`, or `go.sum` were modified.\",\"ttft_ms\":2503,\"ttft_stream_ms\":836,\"time_to_request_ms\":11,\"type\":\"result\",\"duration_ms\":111130,\"uuid\":\"7b5842cc-5fcd-4f37-b3ba-8a996a872355\"}\n",
